      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T05:35:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fact that we only have one UserManager is likely going to bite us soon, or may already be biting us.\n\nNot for this CL, but I think we should probably do something about this. Might it be as easy as the following?\n\n    SparseArray\u003cUserManager\u003e mUserManagers \u003d new SparseArray\u003c\u003e();\n\n    private class MockContext extends BroadcastInterceptingContext {\n\n        ...\n\n        @Override\n        public Context createContextAsUser(UserHandle user, int flags) {\n            final Context asUser \u003d mock(Context.class, AdditionalAnswers.delegatesTo(this));\n\n            doAnswer((inv) -\u003e {\n                final int userId \u003d UserHandle.getIdentifier(user));\n                if (!mUserManager.contains(userId)) {\n                    mUserManagers.put(userId, mock(UserManager.class));\n                }\n                return um;\n            }).when(asUser).getSystemService(UserManager.class);\n\n            doReturn(user).when(asUser).getUser();\n            return asUser;\n        }\n\n        ...\n    }",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10993,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 10993,
        "endChar": 61
      },
      "revId": "7b16496af2c6713644e030b7c311ceb7c632245e",
